## 121. Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock

## Approach
- Keep track of the minimum price seen so far.
- For every price, consider it as the selling price.
- Calculate the current profit using:
  current price - minimum price
- Keep track of the maximum profit found so far.
- If the current price is smaller than the minimum price, update the minimum.
- Finally, return the maximum profit.

## Complexity
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

SOLUTION :
class Solution {
    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {
        int n = prices.length;
        int min = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
        int maxP = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (prices[i] < min)
                min = prices[i];
            int currentP = prices[i] - min;
            if (currentP > maxP)
                maxP = currentP;
        }
        return maxP;
    }
}
